he tiling satisfies all requirements and uses precisely \\(n\\) tiles.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n#### 5.   Conclusion\n\nThe lower bound (7) shows that no tiling can use fewer than \\(n\\) tiles, and the construction above achieves this bound.  \nTherefore the minimum possible number of tiles is  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2025}.\n\\]"
